[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Mechanical derivation of the axes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     4[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     5[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The library's whole branch surface, taken from the source (not from docs):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     6[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
