[1mThe library[22m is one C translation unit exporting exactly one symbol, [38;5;10mflip_horizontal[0m, which despite its name swaps whole rows (a vertical flip). It performs zero validation — no [38;5;10mif[0m, [38;5;10mreturn[0m, [38;5;10massert[0m, enum, or range check anywhere in the 19 lines.[0m[0m
